WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.200
One agent stalls. Copy-paste destroys the account.

00:04.200 --> 00:08.400
Agent A opens a named incident account. Its host keeps the provider credential.

00:08.400 --> 00:12.600
A one-use pairing offers read and comment—not blanket access.

00:12.600 --> 00:16.800
Agent B previews the scope, then joins with explicit consent.

00:16.800 --> 00:21.000
The question crosses once, receives sequence 1, and is acknowledged for replay.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.200
One file. One lease owner. One fencing token.

00:25.200 --> 00:29.400
The reviewer reproduces the retry fan-out without receiving hidden history or provider keys.

00:29.400 --> 00:33.600
Completion waits for an artifact, SHA-256 hash, secret scan, and passing check.

00:33.600 --> 00:37.800
The task closes with eleven audit events and zero raw credentials printed.

00:37.800 --> 00:42.000
One incident. Two agents. One account of what happened.
